<title>USA: Jay Jacobs q1 sales up 8 pct.</title>
<headline>Jay Jacobs q1 sales up 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jay Jacobs Inc said its first quarter sales rise eight percent to $13.5 million and its April comparable store sales increased 24 percent.</p>
<p>The company, an apparel retailer, said it will report full first quarter results by May 31.</p>
</text>
